* PHASE2_REFERENCE_STAGE_Dn port contract:
*   Y         : non-inverting reference-stage output and observable R_i tap.
*   VDD_REF   : reference-island positive rail; it also connects to VNW.
*   VSS_REF   : reference-island return rail; it also connects to VPW.
*   A         : reference-stage input.  Dn selects n extra inverter-input loads.
*
* Dummy inverter outputs are private named nodes and are never tied to either
* rail.  Thus each dummy contributes only a real standard-cell input load.
.subckt PHASE2_REFERENCE_STAGE_D0 Y VDD_REF VSS_REF A
XINV_REF_A PHASE2_REF_MID VDD_REF VDD_REF VSS_REF VSS_REF A INV_X0P5M_A9TR40
XINV_REF_B Y              VDD_REF VDD_REF VSS_REF VSS_REF PHASE2_REF_MID INV_X0P5M_A9TR40
.ends PHASE2_REFERENCE_STAGE_D0

